# The SciELO Brazilian Scientific Journal Gateway and Open Archives; Usability of Hypermedia Educational e-Books; Building Upon the MyLibrary Concept To Better Meet the Information Needs of College Students; Open Archives and UK Institutions; The Utah Digital Newspapers Project; Examples of Practical Digital Libraries.

**Authors:** Marcondes, Carlos Henrique, Sayao, Luis Fernando, Diaz, Paloma, Gibbons, Susan, Pinfield, Stephen, Kenning, Arlitsch, Edge, Karen, Yapp, L., Witten, Ian H.

## Abstract
Includes six articles that focus on practical uses of technologies developed from digital library research in the areas of education and scholarship reflecting the international impact of digital library research initiatives. Includes the Scientific Electronic Library Online (SciELO) (Brazil); the National Science Foundation (NSF) (US); the Joint Information Systems Committee (JISC) (UK); hypermedia educational e-book (Spain); and Greenstone Digital Library Software (New Zealand). (Author/AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ666636

